# Building an image is only meaningful from a protected release snapshot
# (see scripts/release.mjs stage), which whitelists exactly the runtime
# payload below. Building from the repository checkout is refused by
# exclusion: no source tree, no git history and no secret files can ever
# enter an image context, even by accident.
**
!Dockerfile
!app
!app/**
!drizzle
!drizzle/**
!package.json
!bun.lock
